        "- In the Summary Table, the signal words for Future Perfect Continuous are incorrectly listed as \"by + duration\"; \"by\" is followed by a point in time (e.g., by June), while duration is expressed with \"for\" (e.g., for 5 years). → Correct signal words to \"by + point of time, for + duration\".",
